## Android signing

The generator stores the upload keystore and its credentials in AWS Secrets Manager.
Before a local release build, retrieve them into temporary files, create
`android/key.properties`, run `flutter build appbundle`, then delete the temporary files.
The signed bundle is created at `build/app/outputs/bundle/release/app.aab`.
